  "description": "BFS on grids and implicit graphs for coding interviews: multi-source BFS (rotting oranges, 01 matrix, walls and gates), state BFS (open the lock, word ladder, obstacle elimination), 0-1 BFS with a deque and bidirectional BFS, with steppers and Go, C++, Java and Python templates.",
  "hero": {
