      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">45 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip accent\">Deep dive</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Graphs</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">BFS</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Asked by Amazon, Flipkart, Uber, Meta, Google, DoorDash, PhonePe</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>BFS on Grids and Implicit Graphs</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Breadth-first search finds shortest paths when every move costs the same. Four upgrades turn it into a tool for most \"minimum steps\" questions: start from many sources at once, search over states instead of cells, use a deque when moves cost 0 or 1, and search from both ends when the graph explodes.</p>\n"
  },
